#N canvas 50 50 1100 900 10;
#X text 20 5 Lyra - after LIRA-8 (Miguel Moreno). Two triangle oscillators modulate each other. Breath: deeper cross-mod \, sharper waves \, wider beating \, more drive. Knobs: Mod \, Sharp \, Detune \, Drive;
#X obj 20 30 inlet;
#X obj 300 30 inlet;
#X obj 500 30 inlet;
#X obj 20 55 line~;
